to-be-incorporated-into-paper-151 : List Word
to-be-incorporated-into-paper-151 = unlines (cons "In hyperactivity's language as the repository implements it: Besides a shared subterm, held by a duplicating cell that copies lazily, equal terms reached by different routes are also computed once. Every cell that will produce a" (cons "value (a thunk, a saturated call, an application of a known λ, a case) carries a key: its compiled" (cons "body over the keys of the values bound in it, interned, so one term is one pointer. A value's key" (cons "is its constructor over its parts' keys; a held value (a box) is named by what was put in it, and a" (cons "copy out of a box, a definition unfolded, and the scrutinee a case branch rebuilds from the fields" (cons "it took all carry that name, so one value has one name by whatever route it is reached. A producer" (cons "is pending on its key from its creation; when one fires while another of the same key is pending," (cons "its value goes into a box held by the entry, and the other reads the box instead of computing" (cons "(waiting on the wire, uncounted, if the value has not arrived). Retention is reachability: an" (cons "entry lives exactly while a producer is pending or a reader holds the box; the table holds nothing" (cons "on its own, and two boxes with equal values but different origins are not identified (a numeral" (cons "computed by `add` and the same numeral written out are two values). Naive Fibonacci shows it:" (cons "`fib (n+2)` demands `fib (n+1)`, which demands `fib n` while the outer `fib n`" (cons "is pending, so every `fib k` is computed once and the work is linear in the calls (unary addition" (cons "dominates the count), whether the argument is a numeral the machine computed or one written out." nil)))))))))))))))
